:root {
  --ink: #f5f7f8;
  --muted: #a9b5be;
  --panel: rgba(11, 16, 22, 0.72);
  --panel-solid: #0d141b;
  --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  --accent: #ffb347;
  --accent-hot: #ff8a2a;
  --green: #78ffae;
  --green-deep: #1e9d5a;
  --red: #ff6b57;
  --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  --radius: 22px;
  --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  --safe-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html,
body {
  height: 100%;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0c1117;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: "Helvetica Neue", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
  overscroll-behavior: none;
}

body {
  touch-action: none;
}

button {
  font: inherit;
  color: inherit;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

[hidden] {
  display: none !important;
}

#app {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #27405a 0%, #111a23 55%, #080b0f 100%);
}

#scene {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  touch-action: none;
  outline: none;
}

.vignette {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 52%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24) 100%),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18), transparent 18%, transparent 76%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32));
  z-index: 2;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ HUD */

.hud {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 5;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(220px, 360px) 1fr;
  align-items: start;
  gap: 20px;
  padding: calc(16px + var(--safe-top)) clamp(16px, 3vw, 36px) 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
}

.hud-brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 8px;
  justify-self: start;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.48);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.brand-mark {
  font-size: 21px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  line-height: 1;
}

.brand-model {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--accent);
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

.brand-route {
  margin-left: 5px;
  padding-left: 11px;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.22em;
}

.hud-center {
  padding-top: 2px;
}

.progress-wrap {
  padding: 9px 14px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 13px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.5);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.progress-labels {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 7px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.19em;
}

#distance-label {
  color: var(--ink);
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}

.progress-track {
  position: relative;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  overflow: visible;
}

.progress-fill {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0 auto 0 0;
  width: 0%;
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-hot), var(--accent) 55%, var(--green));
  box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.6);
  transition: width 0.2s linear;
}

.progress-truck {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 0%;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 1;
  transform: translate(-50%, -54%);
  text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  transition: left 0.2s linear;
}

.hud-right {
  display: flex;
  justify-self: end;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.stat {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 2px;
  padding: 7px 13px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.5);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.stat-label {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
}

.stat-value {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.icon-btn {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.5);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  pointer-events: auto;
}

.icon-btn svg {
  width: 17px;
  height: 17px;
  fill: currentColor;
  opacity: 0.85;
}

.icon-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
}

.icon-btn:active {
  transform: scale(0.94);
}

.icon-btn.is-off {
  color: var(--red);
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------- speed panel */

.speed-panel {
  position: absolute;
  left: clamp(16px, 3vw, 36px);
  bottom: clamp(20px, 4vh, 42px);
  z-index: 5;
  min-width: 132px;
  padding: 12px 17px 11px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.55);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
}

.speed-dial {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 6px;
}

#speed-value {
  min-width: 58px;
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 54px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 0.88;
  letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.speed-unit {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
}

.gear-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 9px;
  padding-top: 8px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.gear-value {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: #16120b;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 900;
}

.surface-label {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.17em;
}

.surface-label.off-road {
  color: var(--red);
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- hint */

.hint {
  position: absolute;
  top: calc(92px + var(--safe-top));
  left: 50%;
  z-index: 5;
  max-width: min(90vw, 460px);
  padding: 8px 16px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.52);
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-6px);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.hint.is-visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
}

.hint.is-warning {
  border-color: rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.5);
  color: #ffd8d2;
}

.hint.is-go {
  border-color: rgba(120, 255, 174, 0.5);
  color: #d8ffe8;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------- touch controls */

.touch-controls {
  position: absolute;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  z-index: 6;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 18px;
  padding: 18px clamp(16px, 4vw, 34px) calc(18px + var(--safe-bottom));
  pointer-events: none;
}

.control-cluster {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 12px;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.control-btn {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);
  border-radius: 50%;
  background:
    linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03)),
    rgba(9, 14, 19, 0.6);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  box-shadow:
    0 10px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  color: var(--ink);
  cursor: pointer;
  pointer-events: auto;
  touch-action: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  transition: transform 0.08s ease, background 0.08s ease, border-color 0.08s ease;
}

.control-btn svg {
  width: 30px;
  height: 30px;
  fill: currentColor;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.control-btn span {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.control-btn small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 7px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.steer-btn {
  width: 72px;
  height: 72px;
}

.brake-btn {
  width: 74px;
  height: 74px;
  color: #ffd9d3;
  border-color: rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.42);
  background:
    linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.2), rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.04)),
    rgba(9, 14, 19, 0.62);
}

.gas-btn {
  width: 92px;
  height: 92px;
  color: #102015;
  border-color: rgba(120, 255, 174, 0.7);
  background:
    linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(160, 255, 197, 0.98), rgba(74, 210, 128, 0.9)),
    #59d98d;
  box-shadow:
    0 12px 30px rgba(30, 157, 90, 0.36),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
}

.gas-btn small {
  color: rgba(16, 32, 21, 0.64);
}

.control-btn.is-active {
  transform: scale(0.92);
  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.58);
  background:
    linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)),
    rgba(30, 40, 50, 0.8);
}

.gas-btn.is-active {
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #c8ffdc, #6ee89f);
  transform: scale(0.94);
}

.brake-btn.is-active {
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.45), rgba(255, 107, 87, 0.15)), rgba(30, 18, 18, 0.8);
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------- screens */

.screen {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 20;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: 24px;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.screen-shade {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, rgba(5, 9, 13, 0.12) 0%, rgba(5, 9, 13, 0.62) 62%, rgba(4, 7, 10, 0.9) 100%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(4, 7, 10, 0.4), transparent 28%, transparent 70%, rgba(4, 7, 10, 0.6));
  backdrop-filter: blur(1.5px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(1.5px);
}

.start-card,
.pause-card,
.complete-card {
  position: relative;
  width: min(100%, 570px);
  padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 42px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.17);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  background:
    linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(31, 43, 54, 0.82), rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.9) 58%),
    rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.88);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  animation: card-in 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) both;
}

@keyframes card-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.985);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
}

.eyebrow {
  margin: 0 0 10px;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.26em;
}

.start-card h1 {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(58px, 9vw, 88px);
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 0.82;
  letter-spacing: -0.055em;
}

.start-card h1 .hino {
  color: #fff;
}

.start-card h1 .fc {
  color: var(--accent);
  font-size: 0.55em;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.tagline {
  margin: 17px 0 24px;
  color: #cbd5dc;
  font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 17px);
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}

.mission {
  display: grid;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.mission-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 13px;
  padding: 11px 13px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  border-radius: 12px;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
}

.mission-num {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 27px;
  height: 27px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(255, 179, 71, 0.15);
  color: var(--accent);
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.mission-item div {
  display: grid;
  gap: 3px;
}

.mission-item strong {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.mission-item span:not(.mission-num) {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.primary-btn,
.secondary-btn {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 54px;
  padding: 13px 20px;
  border-radius: 13px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
}

.primary-btn {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 205, 130, 0.55);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffc266, #ff9a2e 70%);
  color: #1a1207;
  box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(255, 145, 36, 0.24), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
}

.primary-btn span {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
}

.primary-btn small {
  padding-left: 12px;
  border-left: 1px solid rgba(26, 18, 7, 0.25);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  opacity: 0.65;
}

.primary-btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  box-shadow: 0 16px 38px rgba(255, 145, 36, 0.34), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
}

.primary-btn:active {
  transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.995);
}

.secondary-btn {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
}

.secondary-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
}

.start-meta {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  margin-top: 22px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  border-radius: 11px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
}

.start-meta > div {
  display: grid;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 10px 11px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.55);
}

.start-meta span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 7.5px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
}

.start-meta strong {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.controls-note {
  margin: 18px 0 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  text-align: center;
}

.touch-only {
  display: none;
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------- pause / finish */

.pause-card,
.complete-card {
  width: min(100%, 480px);
  text-align: center;
}

.pause-card h2,
.complete-card h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 58px);
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 0.95;
  letter-spacing: -0.045em;
}

.pause-card > p:not(.eyebrow),
.complete-card > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.record-label) {
  margin: 14px auto 24px;
  max-width: 330px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.55;
}

.button-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 24px;
}

.button-row .primary-btn,
.button-row .secondary-btn {
  flex: 1;
}

.result-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  margin: 24px 0 18px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  border-radius: 13px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
}

.result-grid > div {
  display: grid;
  gap: 7px;
  padding: 14px 9px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.62);
}

.result-grid span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 7.5px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
}

.result-grid strong {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.record-label {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(120, 255, 174, 0.4);
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(120, 255, 174, 0.1);
  color: var(--green);
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------- toast */

.toast {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: calc(104px + var(--safe-bottom));
  left: 50%;
  z-index: 12;
  max-width: min(86vw, 420px);
  padding: 10px 17px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.17);
  border-radius: 99px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 18, 0.8);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-align: center;
  transform: translate(-50%, 10px);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.toast.is-visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translate(-50%, 0);
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------------- loading */

.loading {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 40;
  display: grid;
  place-content: center;
  gap: 18px;
  background: #0b1117;
  text-align: center;
  transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
}

.loading.is-done {
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.loading p {
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.24em;
}

.loading-truck {
  position: relative;
  width: 64px;
  height: 34px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  border-radius: 5px 9px 3px 3px;
  background: #e9eef1;
  animation: truck-bob 0.9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}

.loading-truck::before,
.loading-truck::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -7px;
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  border: 3px solid #0b1117;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #7d8a93;
}

.loading-truck::before {
  left: 8px;
}

.loading-truck::after {
  right: 8px;
}

@keyframes truck-bob {
  to {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------------- responsive */

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .hud {
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-top: calc(10px + var(--safe-top));
  }

  .hud-brand {
    padding: 7px 10px;
  }

  .brand-mark {
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .brand-model {
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .brand-route,
  .stat {
    display: none;
  }

  .hud-center {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .progress-wrap {
    padding: 7px 10px 8px;
  }

  .progress-labels {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-size: 7.5px;
  }

  .hud-right {
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .icon-btn {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
  }

  .speed-panel {
    bottom: calc(190px + var(--safe-bottom));
    left: 16px;
    min-width: 108px;
    padding: 9px 13px 8px;
    border-radius: 13px;
  }

  #speed-value {
    min-width: 44px;
    font-size: 36px;
  }

  .gear-row {
    margin-top: 6px;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }

  .hint {
    top: calc(70px + var(--safe-top));
    font-size: 9.5px;
    padding: 7px 13px;
  }

  .toast {
    bottom: calc(188px + var(--safe-bottom));
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .touch-only {
    display: inline;
  }

  .desktop-only {
    display: none;
  }

  .screen {
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .start-card,
  .pause-card,
  .complete-card {
    padding: 24px 21px;
  }

  .start-card h1 {
    font-size: clamp(52px, 16vw, 72px);
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 13px 0 18px;
  }

  .mission {
    margin-bottom: 19px;
  }

  .start-meta {
    margin-top: 17px;
  }

  .start-meta strong {
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }

  .controls-note {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
}

@media (max-height: 720px) and (max-width: 900px) {
  .mission {
    display: none;
  }

  .start-card h1 {
    font-size: 52px;
  }

  .tagline {
    margin: 10px 0 15px;
  }

  .start-card,
  .pause-card,
  .complete-card {
    padding: 20px 19px;
  }
}

@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) and (min-width: 901px) {
  .touch-controls {
    display: none;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
  }
}

content.text:
Now main.js. Need be meticulous. Let's write in chunks maybe. Large file ~1000 lines. We'll create.

Key parts:

Imports, constants, helpers, audio, textures, scene, truck, world, particles, input, state, update, render.

Let's think through technical details to avoid bugs.

Three.js r160:
- `THREE.MathUtils.damp` exists? There is `damp(x, y, lambda, dt)` in MathUtils. Yes maybe. Use own.
- `renderer.useLegacyLights` removed? Not needed.
- `THREE.PlaneGeometry` etc.

Shadow map:
```
sun.castShadow = true;
sun.shadow.mapSize.set(1024,1024);
const s = 55;
sun.shadow.camera.left=-s; right=s; top=s; bottom=-s; near=1; far=220;
sun.shadow.bias=-0.0004;
sun.shadow.normalBias=0.02;
scene.add(sun);
scene.add(sun.target);
```
Update each frame:
```
sun.position.set(truck.position.x + 55, 85, truck.position.z + 40);
