Physics update:
```
function updateVehicle(dt) {
  const throttle = input.throttle; const brake = input.brake; const steerInput = input.steer;
  const absSpeed = Math.abs(vehicle.speed);
  const offRoad = Math.abs(truck.position.x) > ROAD_HALF + 0.8;
  // Steering
  const speedFactor = clamp(absSpeed/MAX_SPEED,0,1);
  const maxSteer = 0.55 * (1 - speedFactor*0.55);
  const targetSteer = steerInput * maxSteer;
  vehicle.steer = damp(vehicle.steer, targetSteer, steerInput===0?7:5, dt);
  // acceleration
  let a = 0;
  if (throttle > 0) {
    if (vehicle.speed < -0.4) a = 16; // brake reverse
    else a = 7.2 * throttle * (1 - clamp(vehicle.speed/MAX_SPEED,0,0.95)*0.55);
  }
  if (brake > 0) {
    if (vehicle.speed > 0.4) a -= 18*brake;
    else a -= 5.5*brake; // reverse
  }
  if (throttle===0 && brake===0) {
    // rolling resistance
    a -= Math.sign(vehicle.speed) * Math.min(absSpeed/dt, 1.2 + absSpeed*0.08);
  }
  // drag
  a -= vehicle.speed * 0.02;
  if (offRoad) a -= Math.sign(vehicle.speed) * 3.5;
  // handbrake? no
  vehicle.speed += a*dt;
  // clamp
  const maxF = offRoad ? 11 : MAX_SPEED;
  const maxR = offRoad ? 5 : MAX_REVERSE;
  vehicle.speed = clamp(vehicle.speed, -maxR, maxF);
  if (Math.abs(vehicle.speed) < 0.03 && throttle===0 && brake===0) vehicle.speed=0;
  // heading
  if (Math.abs(vehicle.speed) > 0.05) {
    const wheelbase = 4.9;
    vehicle.heading += (vehicle.speed / wheelbase) * Math.tan(vehicle.steer) * dt;
  }
  // position
  const forwardX = -Math.sin(vehicle.heading);
  const forwardZ = -Math.cos(vehicle.heading);
  truck.position.x += forwardX * vehicle.speed * dt;
  truck.position.z += forwardZ * vehicle.speed * dt;
  truck.rotation.y = vehicle.heading;
  // keep within world
  truck.position.x = clamp(truck.position.x, -120, 120);
  truck.position.z = clamp(truck.position.z, -1500, 80);
  // visual lean
  const targetRoll = -vehicle.steer * clamp(vehicle.speed/MAX_SPEED,0,1) * 0.22;
  const targetPitch = -a * 0.006;
  truckVisual.rotation.z = damp(truckVisual.rotation.z, targetRoll, 5, dt);
  truckVisual.rotation.x = damp(truckVisual.rotation.x, targetPitch, 5, dt);
  // wheel spin
  const spinDelta = (vehicle.speed * dt) / 0.5;
  for (w of wheels) w.spin.rotation.x += spinDelta;
  // front steer
  for (w of wheels) if (w.steerable) w.pivot.rotation.y = vehicle.steer;
  // top speed
  state.topSpeed = Math.max(state.topSpeed, absSpeed*3.6);
  // offroad dust
  ...
}
```
Wait rolling resistance formula with `a -= sign * min(absSpeed/dt, ...)`: if dt 0.016 and speed 10, absSpeed/dt = 625, min gives 1.2+0.8=2.0, so decel 2 m/s². Good. But if speed 0.1, min(0.1/0.016=6.25, 1.2+0.008) = 1.2, which would reverse direction. We clamp with `if absSpeed < 0.03` but not enough. Better:
```
const roll = 1.1 + absSpeed*0.06;
const decel = Math.min(absSpeed/dt, roll);
a -= Math.sign(vehicle.speed) * decel;
```
If speed 0.1, decel = min(6.25,1.106)=1.106, speed becomes -0.008 after dt? Actually 0.1 - 1.106*0.016 = 0.082, fine. Over time it approaches zero; clamp when <0.03. Good.
